&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Quantium?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quantium is a world leader in data science and artificial intelligence. Established in Australia in 2002, Quantium is a global team of more than 1,200 people across 14 locations with a unique blend of capabilities across product and consulting services to help businesses unlock value from data and analytics. Quantium partners with the world&#39;s largest corporations to forge a better, more intelligent world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Scientist, AI Solutions you are responsible for designing and delivering production-grade generative AI applications for some of Australia&#39;s largest organisations, taking ownership of solutions from initial design through to client handover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re ALL in on AI, transforming ourselves into an AI-native organisation while helping our clients do the same. With 23 years of domain expertise, proprietary data partnerships, and industry-leading AI adoption (90% weekly active usage), this is an exciting opportunity to join our AI Solutions team in a hands-on technical role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine deep technical expertise in large language models (LLMs), machine learning, and modern cloud technologies with a consultative mindset, working alongside talented data scientists, engineers, and client teams to solve complex business problems. If you thrive in environments where technical rigour meets real-world impact, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical ownership: Take end-to-end ownership of production-grade GenAI and LLM applications, from initial design through to client handover, using Python and frameworks like LangChain and LangGraph&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architectural judgement: Make informed decisions on the right approach for each problem, whether classical ML, LLM prompts, workflows or agents, and architect cloud-native solutions on AWS, Azure or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution quality: Design evaluation frameworks and observability metrics, and build the APIs and data pipelines (SQL, DBT, orchestration tools) that keep solutions reliable in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client engagement: Partner with clients and domain experts to understand problems and validate approaches, translating technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders and flagging risks and trade-offs early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team and growth: Lead code reviews, mentor junior team members and contribute to our technical standards, while supporting business development through technical scoping, solution design and proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The superpowers you&#39;ll be bringing to the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven AI delivery: 5 or more years of experience in data science, AI/ML development or technical consulting, with a track record of delivering production-grade AI/ML solutions end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generative AI expertise: Hands-on experience building LLM applications with LangChain, LangGraph or similar, and a strong understanding of how LLMs and transformer architectures work under the hood, so you know when to apply different approaches and make smart architectural decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering excellence: Strong Python skills with solid software engineering practices (testing, code quality, version control), plus hands-on experience with a major cloud platform (AWS, Azure or GCP) and containerisation (Docker)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data foundations: Working knowledge of SQL and data pipelines, with orchestration tools such as Airflow or Vertex AI Pipelines and DBT a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery mindset: The ability to balance technical excellence with pragmatism, navigate ambiguity, manage competing priorities and consistently deliver quality solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: The ability to explain complex concepts clearly to non-technical audiences and build trusted relationships with client teams, ideally with experience in consulting or client-facing delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Familiarity with ML algorithms (GBM, GLM) and experimentation frameworks such as A/B testing, and contributions to open source or technical communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remember – you might not tick all the boxes, but don’t let that stop you applying. We’re more interested in how you work, your ability to solve problems and think big.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Could Your Quantium Experience Look Like?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Quantium will allow you to challenge your imagination. You will get to solve complex problems using rigour, precision and by asking great questions — but it also means you can think big, outside the box and push your problem-solving skills to the max.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining the Quantium team, you&#39;ll get to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forge your path: &lt;/strong&gt;So many of our team have moved around different teams or offices. You&#39;ll be in the driver&#39;s seat, and we empower you to make your career your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find your kind: &lt;/strong&gt;Embrace diversity and connect with your tribe (think foodies, dog lovers, readers, or runners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make an impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Leave your mark. Your contributions resonate, regardless of your role or rank.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On top of the Quantium Experience, you will enjoy a range of great benefits that go beyond the ordinary. Some of these include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible work arrangements: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve work-life balance at your own pace with hybrid and flexible work arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global mobility: &lt;/strong&gt;As we expand globally, there are lots of exciting opportunities to work abroad with Quantium.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote working: &lt;/strong&gt;Embrace the opportunity to work outside of your assigned home location for up to 30 days every year (eligibility criteria apply).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now and let&#39;s forge a better, more intelligent world together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Quantium’s recruitment process involves the collection and use of personal information, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://quantium.com/candidate-privacy-collection-notice/&quot;&gt;Candidate Data Collection Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information. T&lt;/span&gt;his provides information on how we collect, use &amp;amp; store your personal information, including potential disclosure to our majority shareholder, Woolworths Group Limited.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
